## 11. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause | What to check |
|---|---|---|
| SSH connection times out | Network/security group issue | EC2 public IP, route, inbound TCP 22, your IP |
| SSH permission denied | Wrong username or private key | `ec2-user`, key pair, key permissions |
| `java: command not found` | Java not installed | Install supported Java; check `java -version` |
| `jenkins` package not found | Repository missing/incorrect | Official Jenkins repository instructions |
| Jenkins fails to start | Java mismatch or service issue | `systemctl status`, `journalctl -u jenkins` |
| Browser cannot reach port 8080 | Service or firewall issue | Jenkins status, security group, firewall |
| Initial password missing | First-run state or wrong path | Jenkins logs and package-specific documentation |
| Jenkins becomes slow or stops | Insufficient EC2 resources | Memory, disk space, CPU, service logs |

